# Memory across a long walk (streamed worldgen S5): the heap at its start, then
# across landscapes, down a shaft and back up, must stay within 10% of where it
# stood (tools/web --heap-log reads it). Every place is asked for by name; each
# run is the real walk on the real keys, so the view streams what it would.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/long-walk.tour --seed=7 --hour=11

hour 11
wait 10
place coast
walk 1,0 12 run
walk 0,-1 12 run
place pinewood
walk -1,0 12 run
walk 0,1 12 run
place burning
walk 1,1 12 run
place bonelands
walk -1,-1 12 run
shot 01-overland with realm:surface
place shaft
await raised:underground 400
await portal 15
press use
await realm:underground 60
walk 1,0 12 run
walk 0,1 12 run
walkto shaft 40
await portal 15
press use
await realm:surface 60
walk -1,0 12 run
place coast
walk 0,1 12 run
wait 10
shot 02-back-on-the-coast with realm:surface
